# ---------- Custom accessibility voice ----------
# The reference recording, the pre-generated narration and the app's bundled
# clips ARE committed for this team's shared repo, by explicit choice, so a
# teammate's `git pull` resumes generation rather than starting over. Only the
# dynamic runtime cache stays out: it is ephemeral, per-session output, not a
# checked-in deliverable, and may briefly hold personalised text (a patient's
# name) rather than fixed narration.
